    "DialogText": "You don't have to travel across the entire map looking for available properties.

You can use:

`!region lookFor <type>`

This lists regions of the selected type that are currently available for purchase, along with their prices.

For example:
`!region lookFor Garage`

The currently available property types include:
`Domain`, `Farm`, `Garage`, `Dealership`, `Office` and `FishingHut`

More property types may become available as Gramados expands.

Once you find something that interests you, you can travel to the property and use `!region buy` while standing inside its region.",
